@startuml s3-budget-state-machine
skinparam backgroundColor #07141f
skinparam defaultFontColor #eef4f6
skinparam ArrowColor #2dd4bf
skinparam titleFontColor #d4a84b
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #0d1e2c
  BorderColor #2dd4bf
  FontColor #eef4f6
  StartColor #d4a84b
  EndColor #d4a84b
}
title Budget state machine
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Charging : ask(question)
Charging --> Searching : under hard cap
Charging --> Exceeded : call budget 8 or dollar cap
Searching --> SoftWarn : spent over soft_usd
Searching --> Idle : Finding recorded
SoftWarn --> Idle : Finding recorded. Warn only
Exceeded --> Escalate : BudgetExceeded
Idle --> Pass : BriefScore green
Idle --> Retry : fixable gap and budget left
Idle --> Escalate : same signature twice
Idle --> Escalate : no source found
Retry --> Charging
Pass --> [*]
Escalate --> [*]
@enduml
